*Prerequisite:** &#x60;getVpsChangeHostname&#x60; (read current). - **Extra IPs need separate PTR updates:** &#x60;postVpsReverseDns&#x60;. - **Verify:** &#x60;getVpsInfo&#x60; (look for updated &#x60;vps_hostname&#x60;). 
